  "title": {
    "rendered": "IEC EGY-01"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"18698\" class=\"elementor elementor-18698\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-16219d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"16219d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-363a5eff elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"363a5eff\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<p>Congratulations to the Egyptian Search &amp; Rescue Team EGY-01 for successfully passing the INSARAG External Classification (IEC) as a Medium team from 11 to 15 August 2026 in Egypt! This important achievement highlights the team’s strong operational capabilities, professionalism, and commitment to international search and rescue standards. The classification process, hosted in Egypt, demonstrated the team’s ability to operate effectively in complex emergency environments and to contribute to coordinated international response efforts. This successful classification reflects Egypt’s continued dedication to strengthening global emergency response capacity. The INSARAG Secretariat extends its most sincere congratulations.</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dc7537e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"dc7537e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-53768ee elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"53768ee\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2048\" height=\"690\" src=\"https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-15-at-12.58.24-1-1-2048x690.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-2048x2048 size-2048x2048 wp-image-18706\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-15-at-12.58.24-1-1-2048x690.jpeg 2048w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-15-at-12.58.24-1-1-300x101.jpeg 300w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-15-at-12.58.24-1-1-1024x345.jpeg 1024w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-15-at-12.58.24-1-1-768x259.jpeg 768w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-15-at-12.58.24-1-1-1536x517.jpeg 1536w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-15-at-12.58.24-1-1-1200x404.jpeg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-22c6442 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"22c6442\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7ae897a elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7ae897a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1152\" src=\"https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-15-at-12.58.24-1536x1152.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-1536x1536 size-1536x1536 wp-image-18719\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-15-at-12.58.24-1536x1152.jpeg 1536w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-15-at-12.58.24-300x225.jpeg 300w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-15-at-12.58.24-1024x768.jpeg 1024w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-15-at-12.58.24-768x576.jpeg 768w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-15-at-12.58.24-2048x1536.jpeg 2048w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-15-at-12.58.24-1200x900.jpeg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
